        "bookId": 64,
        "chapterId": 136,
        "headingId": 779,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a central cystic, dilated follicular infundibulum surrounded by immature villous hair follicles in different stages of development.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2025-04-24T18:27:31"
      }
    ],
